          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="High‑profile instances of private operators unilaterally throttling or denying network/services in the conflict increase foreign stakeholders' perception that dependence on externally‑controlled commercial networks creates strategic vulnerabilities in tech and communications engagements." />
