          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Greater diplomatic engagement (deconfliction and negotiations) among external actors focused on communications-access and escalation management reduces the probability of hostile state or proxy actions against Gulf energy flows, lowering the risk premium embedded in crude prices." />
