          <attvalue for="28" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A sustained rise in crude prices raises France's import bill and domestic inflation expectations and forces larger fiscal support for households/industries, prompting investors to demand higher long-term yields on French government debt." />
