          <attvalue for="28" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Sustained higher crude prices materially increase Russian hydrocarbon revenues and fiscal space, enabling greater military sustainment and procurement that raises the likelihood of offensive operations or escalation in Ukraine." />
