          <attvalue for="34" value="0.65" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Rising war/political‑risk insurance premia raise operating costs and lower expected returns for firms building AI infrastructure (and for funds underwriting those builds), causing financiers to trim exposure to new AI deployments and slowing capital flows." />
