          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.55" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Rising maritime insurance premia act as a market signal of elevated geopolitical and trade risk, leading investors to widen credit spreads and demand a higher risk premium on French sovereign debt to compensate for deteriorating external trade and fiscal outlooks." />
