          <attvalue for="34" value="0.75" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Rising war/political-risk insurance premiums for Gulf routes make logistics and inventory more expensive and volatile, prompting firms and purchasers to accelerate supplier and route diversification away from chokepoint-dependent sources." />
