          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Faster contagion of sovereign stress across markets forces smaller regional datacenter operators, niche cloud providers and specialty financiers to curtail operations or exit, driving customers and projects to a smaller set of large global providers and thereby increasing counterparty concentration." />
