          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Faster transmission of euro-area financial stress into global markets amplifies risk premia and safe‑haven flows, which push benchmark crude prices up as markets price in higher supply‑disruption and financing risk tied to the Gulf." />
